# Canonicalize text line endings to LF so committed artifact bytes -- and the
# provenance SHA-256s that pin them (data/provenance/manifest.json,
# ml/model/model_meta.json) -- are identical on Windows, macOS and Linux CI.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows materializes CRLF working copies
# while the committed blobs (and Linux CI) are LF, so the raw-byte SHA-256
# checks in app/services/provenance.py drift. See data/provenance/manifest.json.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never apply line-ending conversion.
*.joblib binary
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.nc binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
